sources.discovery.json:
{
  "schema": "business-discovery/v1",
  "project_id": "team-files-otel-dialogue-20261101-03",
  "layout_id": "team-files-otel-dialogue-20261101-03",
  "title": "Team file sharing",
  "goal": "Build a small Python and SQLite team file-sharing page with administrator review, designated-recipient access, delayed notifications and real OpenTelemetry observation.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "U_REQUEST",
      "kind": "user",
      "text": "请使用 $vibelens，明确读取 C:/Users/Lvi_P/Documents/Work/CF/平台软著/SoftwareStatusObserverSkill/skills/vibelens/SKILL.md（当前 feat/otel-provenance 分支），在全新的独立目录 C:/Users/Lvi_P/Documents/Work/CF/平台软著/VibeLensTrials/otel-provenance-dialogue-20261101-03 中开发，先读其中 AGENTS.md。不要读取或复制其他试用项目的实现。\n\n我想做一个小型团队文件共享网页。成员登录后上传文件，管理员审核；通过后，上传者可以分享给指定同事，对方能查看和下载。审核结果和共享消息由后台任务稍后送到各自的消息列表。我想在 VibeLens 里看懂登录、审核、共享，还有后台等待与投递的实际过程。界面简单一些，有文件、审核和消息列表就够了。用 Python、SQLite 和简单前端，接入这个分支的 OpenTelemetry 采集。先和我确认必要的业务细节，在对话中画出业务图让我确认，再开始实现。",
      "locator": "Current chat: initial user request carried by codex_delegation"
    },
    {
      "id": "A_Q1",
      "kind": "assistant",
      "text": "VibeLens 的开发方式选哪一种？drive：程序按状态声明执行，图与程序共用状态规则；observe：程序自行实现业务逻辑，图观察实际执行。两种都会维护业务图并接入 OpenTelemetry。",
      "locator": "Current chat: request_user_input_async call_03d9ba875378427d85e8cf99eeba6366 item 0"
    },
    {
      "id": "U_A1",
      "kind": "user",
      "text": "drive：按状态声明执行",
      "locator": "Current chat: send_user_message_question_reply for item 0"
    },
    {
      "id": "A_Q2",
      "kind": "assistant",
      "text": "文件未通过审核时，上传者和管理员各能做什么？这里也决定管理员审核时能否打开或下载文件。",
      "locator": "Current chat: request_user_input_async call_03d9ba875378427d85e8cf99eeba6366 item 1"
    },
    {
      "id": "U_A2",
      "kind": "user",
      "text": "上传者、管理员均可查看和下载；其他成员不可访问",
      "locator": "Current chat: send_user_message_question_reply for item 1"
    },
    {
      "id": "A_Q3",
      "kind": "assistant",
      "text": "审核或共享提交成功后，结果与访问权限何时生效？",
      "locator": "Current chat: request_user_input_async call_03d9ba875378427d85e8cf99eeba6366 item 2"
    },
    {
      "id": "U_A3",
      "kind": "user",
      "text": "通知投递成功后才生效",
      "locator": "Current chat: send_user_message_question_reply for item 2"
    },
    {
      "id": "I_DELIVERY",
      "kind": "inference",
      "text": "A review decision and a recipient grant remain ineffective while their notification waits. The worker writes the notification and activates the related result together in one SQLite transaction. Review notifications go to the uploader; share notifications go to the designated recipient.",
      "locator": "Candidate interpretation of U_REQUEST and U_A3; awaiting the business diagram confirmation"
    },
    {
      "id": "A_GRAPH",
      "kind": "assistant",
      "text": "请确认这张业务图：审核通知投递前不能分享，共享通知投递前接收者不能查看或下载；后台把消息写入对应消息列表并让结果生效。这个理解是否正确？",
      "locator": "Current chat: design diagram confirmation accompanying review/design-preview.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "U_CONFIRM",
      "kind": "user",
      "text": "对，就按这张图。消息写进收件人的列表算投递成功，和审核结果或共享权限生效放在同一个事务里；没投递成功就保持等待，不提前生效。上传者和管理员在所有文件状态下都能查看、下载，但管理员不能审核自己的文件。只有上传者能分享自己的已生效文件，接收者不能转分享。审核消息发给上传者，共享消息发给指定同事，消息只能各自查看。驳回保留文件和原因，这一版不做重新提交；文件信息和下载就够了，不做预览。先准备两个管理员、两个普通成员供试用，不做注册。开始实现吧，把应用和 VibeLens 一起跑起来。",
      "locator": "Current chat: explicit graph confirmation and implementation authorization, 2026-11-01"
    },
    {
      "id": "U_REVOKE",
      "kind": "user",
      "text": "再加一个撤销共享的功能。上传者可以撤销给某位同事的共享，对方要立即不能再下载。还在等待通知的共享也能撤销，旧通知后来送达也不能恢复权限。撤销通知仍然发给这位同事。",
      "locator": "Current continuation chat: delegated user request from 01a1439a-dceb-7ba2-bada-546619caf220, 2026-11-01"
    },
    {
      "id": "A_REVOKE_ADMIN",
      "kind": "assistant",
      "text": "原有规则允许管理员始终查看、下载文件。如果被撤销共享的同事也是管理员，撤销后是否仍保留其管理员权限？这决定撤销规则与既有管理员权限如何衔接。",
      "locator": "Current continuation chat: request_user_input_async question, 2026-11-01"
    },
    {
      "id": "U_REVOKE_ADMIN",
      "kind": "user",
      "text": "保留管理员原有权限，撤销只移除共享授权",
      "locator": "Current continuation chat: explicit authority clarification, 2026-11-01"
    },
    {
      "id": "U_REVOKE_GRAPH",
      "kind": "user",
      "text": "这张流程图符合我的意思，就按这个做。",
      "locator": "Current continuation chat: explicit graph confirmation, 2026-11-01"
    }
  ],
  "networks": [
